ive is we are centralizing those procurement functions such that no matter where in the world we are acquiring panels or where in the world we are acquiring turbines, we are doing it with the strength and scale of our entire global…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/11/04/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q3-2020-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2020 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2021-02-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"…commercial priorities, including delivering on almost four -- sorry, including delivering on almost $40 million of cost-saving initiatives, securing contracts to deliver 3,500 gigawatt hours of clean energy annually, which has the equivalent carbon avoidance of planning almost 30 million trees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/02/04/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q4-2020-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2021 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2021-05-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"And if anything, over the last few years, government tariffs have actually, in general, been shortening and corporate contracting has been lengthening in terms of contract.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/05/04/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q1-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2021 Q3","e":"bep","d":"2021-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"We're being able to pass through that increased price into the PPA.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q3-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2021 Q3","e":"bep","d":"2021-11-05","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"This comes from inflation escalation in our contracts, margin expansion through revenue growth and cost reduction initiatives, and the building out of our growing development pipeline, including eight gigawatts of capacity over the next three years at premium returns.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/11/06/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q3-2021-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2022 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2022-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Natalie Adomait","x":"I'll pass it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q1-2022-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2022 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2022-05-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"The price increases that we are seeing are very modest relative to the benefits of decarbonization, energy security and having stable power prices in an environment where global energy prices are very, very volatile.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/05/06/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q1-2022-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2022 Q2","e":"bep","d":"2022-08-05","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"Feed in tariffs do exist and will continue to exist for a while.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q2-2022-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2022 Q2","e":"bep","d":"2022-08-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"It's simply we are able to pass that price increase through to customers because renewable still is cheaper than the alternative of thermals, which has gone up in price even more.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/08/05/brookfield-renewable-partners-lp-bep-q2-2022-earni/"},{"c":"BEP 2022 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2023-02-03","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Wyatt Hartley","x":"…of generation available for recontracting across our portfolio over the next five years and the positive pricing environment for our hydro portfolio, we have significant capacity across our fleet to execute on accretive contracts that we expect to contribute additional FFO and generate a…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/02/03/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q4-2022-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2023 Q2","e":"bep","d":"2023-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"There is one caveat to that, which is in the U.S., where some of the ongoing investigations and tariff discussions have muted some of those dynamics.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/04/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q2-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2023 Q2","e":"bep","d":"2023-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"And in doing so, what we wanted to avoid is running around the world chasing government tariffs that could, in fact, get removed with a change in government or a change in policy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/04/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q2-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2023 Q2","e":"bep","d":"2023-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jeh Vevaina","x":"These cost savings were not factored into our purchase price multiple, and we are well-positioned to execute these initiatives given our experience acquiring and integrating assets.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2023/08/04/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q2-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2023 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2024-02-02","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Stephen Gallagher","x":"Increasing demand for cloud computing from digitalization and the adoption of AI-enabled tools are driving these companies to continue to invest heavily in their capabilities and capacity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/02/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q4-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2023 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2024-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Stephen Gallagher","x":"With that, I will pass it on to Wyatt to discuss our operating results and financial position.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/02/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q4-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2023 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2024-02-02","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"And the way this shows up in terms of pricing is the dynamic that we've been seeing for a number of years now, which is we are able to pass through higher capex costs, higher funding costs through to the off-taker in the form of higher PPA prices while preserving our development margin.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/02/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q4-2023-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2024 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2024-05-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"The leading global technology companies, who reported results over the past two weeks, all highlighted significant increases in their capital budgets to fund cloud and AI infrastructure growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q1-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2024 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2024-05-03","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"The role that computer chips play in delivering the compute power behind AI is well understood by the market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q1-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2024 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2024-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"And via that group, we've been constantly diversifying our ability to procure planels from different sources that give us a lot of flexibility as we manage through what is a very fluid situation in terms of tariffs and trade actions to the United States.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/brookfield-renewable-partners-bep-q1-2024-earnings/"},{"c":"BEP 2024 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2024-05-03","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"You've got the dynamics in the United States that are impacted by the trade discussions and the tariffs, in the United States, solar panel prices have come down materially in the last 12 months.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/03/brookfiel