-transcript/"},{"c":"BEP 2025 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2026-01-30","l":"pricing_power","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"And with that, I'll pass it on to Patrick to discuss our operating results our diverse sources of scale capital our balance sheet as well as our recent capital recycling initiatives.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/brookfield-renewable-bep-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BEP 2025 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2026-01-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Nelson Ng","x":"And should that streamline your asset recycling process going forward?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/brookfield-renewable-bep-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BEP 2025 Q4","e":"bep","d":"2026-01-30","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"Therefore, yes, we have accelerated or increased our outlook for batteries, but it's very simply just a reflection of what we're seeing across our business and what we're doing with our sovereign wealth fund partner, we would expect to do other similar projects, like that going forward.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/30/brookfield-renewable-bep-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BEP 2026 Q1","e":"bep","d":"2026-05-01","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Connor Teskey","x":"With that, I will pass it on to Patrick to discuss our operating results in more detail, our financial position and funding activities, and the potential simplification of our structure to a single listed corporate entity.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/bep-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[34,1,5011,0,0,0,3848,848],[35,1,6512,0,0,0,4923,1190],[38,1,7679,0,0,0,5745,1361],[42,1,8623,0,0,0,6604,1629],[43,1,7532,0,0,0,5682,1459],[44,1,8333,0,0,0,6756,1286],[45,1,9425,0,0,0,7589,1437],[46,1,9238,0,0,0,7115,1709],[47,1,8131,0,0,0,6377,1430],[48,1,10304,0,0,0,8457,1484],[49,1,8634,0,0,0,6790,1396],[50,1,8477,0,0,0,6652,1315]